        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Amy Lee, Jimi Hendrix, Dave Eggar\n- Roles: singer, songwriter, record producer, multi-instrumentalist, film score composer, electric guitarist, musician\n- Organizations: Evanescence\n- Products: War Story, Voice from the Stone, Speak to Me\n- Topics: film scoring, popular music influence\n\nFacts:\n- Amy Lynn Hartzler, née Lee, was born on December 13, 1981, and is professionally known as Amy Lee.\n- Amy Lee is an American singer, songwriter, record producer, and multi-instrumentalist.\n- During Evanescence's hiatus in 2013, Amy Lee began her film score career.\n- Amy Lee composed the soundtrack to the 2014 film War Story with cellist Dave Eggar.\n- Amy Lee and Dave Eggar also composed a soundtrack for a 2015 film title that is blank in the source text.\n- Amy Lee wrote the song Speak to Me for the film Voice from the Stone.\n- Jimi Hendrix's mainstream career lasted only four years.\n- Jimi Hendrix is widely regarded as one of the most influential electric guitarists in the history of popular music and one of the most celebrated musicians of the 20th century.",
